      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY LACEY (6) missed the frame last time but prior to that was an effortless Grade 5 winner (23.06) at this track, scoring by 5.5 lengths. Has good speed and can quickly clear the tricky draw. Can turn form around here. TOTAL TRIGGER (8) has a strong record this trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Scored by 2.75 lengths last time (23.18) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Can feature in the finish. ARMATREE STRIPE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.93) at Richmond behind Love Over Gold in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Must be included in calculations. LITTLE ESMERALDA (3) was in the money last start despite a big quote and is likely to feature again.",
